AWJ Store — Storefront

This directory contains a fork of Spree Storefront, used as the foundation
for AWJ Store's buyer-facing storefront.

Upstream origin:
  Repository : https://github.com/spree/storefront
  Revision   : 2ad6ad5bd1bcc055467064bd57cf20ab5f711c88 (2026-09-06)
  License    : MIT (see LICENSE file in this directory)
  Copyright  : Vendo Connect Inc., Vendo Sp. z o.o.

The original LICENSE file is preserved as required by the MIT License terms.

AWJ modifications are documented in the commit history. The storefront UI
is adapted to consume AWJ Commerce APIs (Laravel) instead of the original
Spree Rails backend. The Spree Rails backend is not used or included.
